From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Radsat Developers <dev@radsat.local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:10:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm: bbb: boot Linux by mmc host, not PARTUUID

Linux 4.4 names the SD slot mmcblk0 and the eMMC mmcblk1 (host index).
part uuid on these MBRs does not match the PARTUUID the kernel publishes,
so root=PARTUUID=4b4c4e59-02 waits forever even after both cards enumerate.

Pass root=/dev/mmcblk${mmcdev}p2. mmcdev 0 is the SD card, 1 is the eMMC,
and partition 2 is the rootfs on both images.

Saved MRAM envs still carry the old args_mmc, and a loaded env replaces
the compiled-in default. board_late_init overwrites args_mmc on every
boot so an old env cannot put PARTUUID back on the command line.

---
 board/ti/am335x/board.c            |  8 ++++++++
 include/configs/beaglebone-black.h |  6 +++---
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/board/ti/am335x/board.c b/board/ti/am335x/board.c
--- a/board/ti/am335x/board.c
+++ b/board/ti/am335x/board.c
@@ -583,6 +583,14 @@ int board_late_init(void)
 			setenv("boot_targets", "legacy_mmc0");
 		}
 	}
+	/*
+	 * Override a saved args_mmc. mmc0 is the SD slot, mmc1 is eMMC,
+	 * and Linux names them mmcblk0 and mmcblk1 to match.
+	 */
+	setenv("args_mmc",
+	       "setenv bootargs console=ttyS0,115200 ${optargs} "
+	       "root=/dev/mmcblk${mmcdev}p2 ro rootfstype=ext4 rootwait");
 #endif
 #ifdef CONFIG_ENV_VARS_UBOOT_RUNTIME_CONFIG
 	int rc;
diff --git a/include/configs/beaglebone-black.h b/include/configs/beaglebone-black.h
--- a/include/configs/beaglebone-black.h
+++ b/include/configs/beaglebone-black.h
@@ -97,10 +97,10 @@
     "mmcdev=0\0" \
     "mmcrootfstype=ext4 rootwait\0" \
     "finduuid=part uuid mmc ${bootpart} uuid\0" \
-    "args_mmc=run finduuid;setenv bootargs console=ttyS0,115200 " \
+    "args_mmc=setenv bootargs console=ttyS0,115200 " \
         "${optargs} " \
-        "root=PARTUUID=${uuid} ro " \
-        "rootfstype=${mmcrootfstype}\0" \
+        "root=/dev/mmcblk${mmcdev}p2 ro " \
+        "rootfstype=ext4 rootwait\0" \
     "bootfile=kernel\0" \
     "console=ttyS0,115200\0" \
     "optargs=\0" \
